[i]Version 3.6.0[/i]
[hr][/hr]
[h1]v3.6.0 🧰SHARED UI TOOLKIT FOR MODDERS🧰[/h1]
[hr][/hr]
[b]🛠️ UPDATE[/b]
[i]This update adds new building blocks other Cosmic mods (and any modder who depends on Cosmic Vault) can use to build consistent-looking tabs and settings screens. No player-facing changes on its own — this powers visual updates landing in Cosmic Overhaul this same release.[/i]

[b]✨ NEW[/b]
[list]
[*]🧰 [b]UI Kit API:[/b] A shared toolkit for building player-window tabs with a consistent look: a two-row header layout, a sortable scrolling table, and a common set of status colors (green/amber/red).
[*]🗂️ [b]Settings Schema API:[/b] A simpler way for mods to define and store per-player settings with built-in validation, instead of every mod hand-rolling its own.
[*]🎨 [b]New Shared Icon:[/b] Added a new shared icon asset, used by Cosmic Ascendancy's new Eclipse Command Interface window this same release.
[/list]

[b]🪲 BUGFIXES[/b]
[list]
[*]💰 [b]Story Mission Rewards Now Actually Pay Out:[/b] Fixed a bug where completing certain story missions in Cosmic Chronicles could fail to actually credit you the reward money, even though it announced the reward in chat.
[*]📋 [b]Buff System Log Spam Reduced:[/b] Under a rare condition, a ship's temporary stat buff (e.g. from a captain trait) could fail to attach and then keep retrying every few seconds without end, flooding the server log. This no longer happens — a failed attach now backs off for 15 seconds before trying again.
[/list]

[i]Version 3.5.0[/i]
[hr][/hr]
[h1]v3.5.0 🛠️STABILITY & COMPATIBILITY UPDATE!🛠️[/h1]
[hr][/hr]
[b]🛠️ MAJOR STABILITY PASS[/b]
[i]After weeks of deep audit of the entire Vault library turned up (and fixed) a long list of quiet bugs — some of which meant entire features were silently doing nothing.[/i]

[b]📖 CODEX UPDATED[/b]
[list]
📖[*] Updated Cosmic Vault's codex entry with up-to-date information.
📖[*] Cosmic Configuration Menu UI has been visually overhauled.
[/list]

[b]✨ NEW[/b]
[list]
[*]📰 [b]News API Upgraded:[/b] The shared News API mods use to post Galactic News now formally supports marking an article as "Breaking News", and gained a working way to read back the current news list from server-side code.
[/list]

[b]🪲 BUGFIXES[/b]
[list]
[*]💪 [b]Permanent Buffs Fixed:[/b] Permanent stat buffs (used heavily by Cosmic Ascendancy's boss/relic systems) could be applied but never properly removed or refreshed, silently building up over time. Fixed for good.
[*]🚀 [b]Fleet Escort Orders Fixed:[/b] Ordering an AI ship to escort a target quietly failed to actually track that target. Escort orders now work correctly.
[*]📦 [b]Custom Loot Drops Fixed:[/b] Custom item/good drops from events and missions were dropping [b]zero[/b] units regardless of the amount requested. Loot now drops the correct quantity.
[*]🔫 [b]Custom Turret Loot Fixed:[/b] Turrets generated through the Vault's turret-generation tool were silently ignoring their intended rarity and material, always falling back to defaults. Rarity and material now apply correctly.
[*]🖼️ [b]Cinematic Banners/Popups:[/b] Fixed a rare case where cinematic banner and popup messages could fail to display for a player.
[*]☀️ [b]Solar Flare Weather Fixed:[/b] The Solar Flare hazard's shield/hull damage and its "heavily armored ships take less damage" resistance check were both broken and could crash the sector. Solar Flares now correctly damage ships and correctly reward tanky ship designs with reduced damage.
[*]⚖️ [b]Buff Strength Values Corrected:[/b] Temporary stat buffs/debuffs applied via the Vault's buff system were doing the [i]opposite[/i] of what was intended in some cases (e.g. a "half speed" slow could accidentally act as a speed boost). Buff strength now behaves exactly as advertised.
[*]🌩️ [b]Weather System Fully Restored:[/b] A deeper namespace bug meant the entire server-side weather-triggering system wasn't reachable at all — any mod trying to start or clear a weather hazard through the Vault's API was silently doing nothing. Fully repaired.
[*]🛡️ [b]Crash Prevention:[/b] Closed off several additional rare crash and freeze risks in the sector-scaling, faction-index, and progression/settings systems, found during this audit.
[*]🤝 [b]Custom Faction Traits Now Actually Show Up:[/b] Turns out the Custom Faction Traits feature has never actually appeared in the vanilla diplomacy window — the hook was wired into the wrong function the whole time. Fixed for real this time, and other mods' custom traits (like Cosmic War's) will now correctly display.
[*]⚠️ [b]Weather Warning Icons Restored:[/b] The little warning icon/tooltip that's supposed to appear when you're flying through a weather hazard (Ion Storm, Solar Flare, etc.) was calling into a UI hook that doesn't exist in the game, so it never actually showed up. Rebuilt using the same real system vanilla uses for its own ship warnings.
[*]⌨️ [b]Chat-Safe Hotkeys, For Real This Time:[/b] The "don't fire hotkeys while typing in chat" protection has quietly never worked since it was first introduced, because it leaned on an engine function that doesn't exist. Replaced with an actual working chat-detection system.
[*]🗺️ [b]Territory Flips Restored:[/b] When another Cosmic mod (like Cosmic War) told the Vault "this siege is over, flip this sector," the request was being saved in the wrong internal format and silently ignored — meaning conquered sectors could fail to actually change hands, and could also wipe out any of the Vault's own pending territory changes. Fixed so flips reliably go through.
[*]🚀 [b]Custom Ship/Station Spawner Fixed:[/b] The tool used to spawn custom ships and stations from a blueprint would crash outright whenever a target size was specified, and always failed to give the new ship or station a proper crew. Both are now fixed.
[*]📖 [b]Codex Info Pages Restored:[/b] The Cosmic Vault info section of the in-game Codex (the "What is Cosmic Vault?" pages) has been silently failing to load due to a file-path issue. Fixed.
[*]💹 [b]Price Hook API Implemented:[/b] The documented tool for letting mods hook into and adjust good prices dynamically was referenced in the guide but never actually built. It's now implemented and working.
[*]🧯 [b]Famine Relief Cache No Longer Requires Chronicles:[/b] The "Famine Relief Cache" reward that can spawn in starving territories was quietly depending on a Cosmic Chronicles file that isn't part of the Vault. Installs without Chronicles now spawn the cache safely instead of hitting an error.
[*]🌀 [b]Boss-Kill Anomalies Now Actually Work:[/b] The "Unstable Spatial Rift" and "Ancient Precursor Wreck" that can appear after defeating Bottan or an Eclipse Boss were spawning with no actual content — interacting with them threw a "Script not found" error and they did nothing. Both are now fully working, one-time interactive rewards with a scaled credit/resource payout and a chance at a bonus turret or upgrade.
[/list]

