[b]🗃️NEW FEATURES:[/b]
[list]
[*]✨ Added new commands for AI ships, allowing mods to safely order them to mine and salvage automatically without breaking vanilla AI.
[*]✨ Expanded the Mission system to allow mods to easily handle mission failures and grant physical item rewards safely.
[*]✨ Added new tools for spawning physical upgrade drops dynamically into space.
[*]✨ Added a permanent buffs system to allow mods to safely multiply ship stats indefinitely without causing lag or stat-stacking exploits.
[*]✨ Upgraded the station interaction menus to support custom distances, preventing UI exploits from too far away.
[*]✨ Implemented aggressive "type-checking" across the framework. If another mod sends bad data to Cosmic Vault, it will now catch it and block it rather than crashing your server!
