[*]⚙️ [b]Keybind Adjustments:[/b] Unbound the default keys for the Cosmic Vault UI tabs (Cosmic Codex, Config Menu). They now default to unbound to allow players to set their own custom shortcuts without overlapping with other mods.

[i]Version 3.1.0[/i]
[hr][/hr]
[h1]🛠️V3.1.0 ARCHITECTURE & OPTIMIZATION UPDATE!🛠️[/h1]
[hr][/hr]
[b]🛠️ API & UI UPDATE[/b]
[i]This minor update completely overhauls the Cosmic Vault Weather API to integrate natively with Avorion's UI and data structures! Note: Dedicated servers will require client version matching due to the API restructuring.[/i]
[list]
[*]⚙️ [b]Native UI Integration:[/b] Completely refactored the Weather HUD to utilize Avorion's native `addSectorProblem()` API instead of drawing custom floating text rectangles. Weather warnings now seamlessly hook into your vanilla UI layout with standard icons and hover tooltips.
[*]⚙️ [b]Weather Data Dictionary:[/b] Replaced hardcoded weather logic with a centralized data dictionary (`cosmicvaultweatherdictionary.lua`). Modders can now easily inject custom weather hazards complete with native UI bindings!
[*]⚖️ [b]Dynamic Hazard Protection:[/b] Added a dynamic `isShipPrepared()` callback to the Weather API. Players caught in a Solar Flare who possess a heavily armored ship (Trinium or above) will now natively resist 50% of the physical hull damage.
[*]🐛 [b]API Crash Fix:[/b] Fixed a critical server crash in the Weather API's synchronization loop where an invalid engine function (server:getPlayers()) was used instead of server:getOnlinePlayers(). This resolves a severe crash when players log in or weather is created.
[/list]

[i]Version 3.0.3[/i]
[hr][/hr]
[h1]🛠️V3.0.3 API & OPTIMIZATION PATCH!🛠️[/h1]
[hr][/hr]
[b]🛠️ API UPDATE[/b]
[i]This patch synchronizes precision siege timer data for cross-mod UI displays![/i]
[*]🛠️ [b]Precise Siege Timers:[/b] Upgraded `CosmicVaultTerritory.setContestedZone()` to securely store `startTime` inside the serialized sector strings. This guarantees flawless absolute progression tracking and perfectly synchronized visual HUD splitters for joining players, eliminating the visual jump glitch previously seen when joining sieges mid-way. Existing active sieges are backward-compatible.

[i]Version 3.0.2[/i]
[hr][/hr]
[h1]🐛V3.0.2 BUGFIX UPDATE!🐛[/h1]
[hr][/hr]
[b]🛠️ HOTFIX PATCH[/b]
[i]This small patch fixes issues regarding keybinds![/i]
[*]🐛 [b]Config Unbind Bug:[/b] Fixed an issue where the Cosmic Config Menu would close itself when players tried to use Escape to unbind a hotkey. Re-mapped the unbind action to the `Delete` or `Backspace` keys, properly displaying this instruction in the capture prompt.
[*]🐛 [b]Chat Hotkey Bleed:[/b] Fixed a highly disruptive bug where CCM hotkeys would randomly fire and open menus while a player was trying to type a sentence in the chat window. The `ccm.lua` API now leverages the `checkInputFocus()` check to block inputs if the player is currently typing in a text field.

[i]Version 3.0.1[/i]
