[i]This small patch fixes issues regarding the Dynamic Weather API![/i]
[*]🐛 Fixed a synchronization bug in the Dynamic Weather controller where clients would always default to rendering the "Ion Storm" UI warning regardless of the actual weather type. Weather types are now correctly synchronized and displayed.
[*]🛠️ Added high-priority chat warnings for players entering hazard zones (Solar Flares, Dark Matter Fog, etc.).

[h1]⭐ [THE ASCENSION ERA] - Cosmic Vault Update 3.0.0! ⭐[/h1]

[hr][/hr]

[h3]📡 What's New in The Ascension Era?[/h3]
The ultimate architectural overhaul has arrived! Version 3.0.0 completely rewrites the Vault to support the massive Cosmic Ascendancy endgame crisis, while heavily optimizing server performance and resolving critical multiplayer bugs.

[b]⚠️ NEW SAVE FILE HARD REQUIRED ⚠️[/b]
The core architecture has changed significantly. You must start a new galaxy!

[hr][/hr]

✅ [b]NEW FEATURES & ARCHITECTURE[/b]
[list]
[*]📖 [b]Cosmic Codex Integration:[/b] Built a massive new 3-level UI framework (Category -> Chapter -> Article). Players can now read all deep lore, stat blocks, and dynamic recipes directly in-game.
[*]⌨️ [b]Cosmic Configuration Menu (CCM):[/b] A universal mod configuration API! Set custom keybinds, utilize global hotkeys (ALT+P for Codex, ALT+O for Config), and easily revert with dedicated reset buttons.
[*]⚙️ [b]Ascendancy Architecture:[/b] Designed and deployed the global API hooks required to support [b]Cosmic Ascendancy's[/b] Megastructures, Stellar Forge, and The Eclipse faction.
[*]🌐 [b]Universal Persistence API (ARCC):[/b] Rewrote the database into a high-performance system. UI configurations now persist seamlessly across sessions.
[*]🌦️ [b]Dynamic Weather API & UI:[/b] New native HUD indicators dynamically render active debuff icons. Dark Matter Fogs and Ion Storms dynamically impact sieges and commands globally.
[*]🤝 [b]Custom Faction Traits API:[/b] Easily inject custom faction traits that render beautifully in the native Avorion diplomacy UI!
[*]📉 [b]Deep Economy Warfare:[/b] Track faction resource starvation! Famine scores exceeding 100 natively force starvation-driven invasions. Famine Relief Anomalies now dynamically spawn in starving territories.
[*]⚔️ [b]Dynamic Combat & Scaling APIs:[/b] Calculates defensive arrays to spawn mathematically balanced invasion fleets. Fortified factions globally multiply defensive volume by 1.3x! Plus, native floating combat text for DoTs.
[*]🗺️ [b]Territory & Faction Generation APIs:[/b] Allows background border shifting, station captures, and natively instantiating civilized/pirate outposts into uncharted sectors.
[*]🌌 [b]Global Rift Escalation:[/b] The Vault now tracks global Rift Guardian kills. As the Escalation Level rises, severe Xsotan attack swarms have a chance to converge on all online players!
[*]📡 [b]Unified News API:[/b] Consolidated ambient galactic news into a single, validated API that prevents destroyed ghost empires from broadcasting.
[/list]

⚙️ [b]CHANGED & BALANCED[/b]
[list]
[*]🤝 [b]Alliance PvP Mirroring:[/b] Dynamically mirrors reputation shifts to the player's active Alliance, destroying the PvP safe-harbor exploit globally across all Cosmic mods.
[*]🎨 [b]UI Polish & Notifications:[/b] Revamped Config Menu with a cleaner 3-column layout, text-wrapping, and upgraded success notifications using proper overlay channels.
[*]📚 [b]LDoc Standardization:[/b] Auto-generated docstrings injected across all 28 exposed library functions to heavily enhance modder readability.
[*]⚖️ [b]Scaling Sanity Check:[/b] Added a hard cap to defensive volume scaling (500 million) to mathematically prevent Avorion shipyard generation crashes.
[*]🌑 [b]Eclipse Immunity:[/b] Adjusted the Dark Matter Fog debuff to natively ignore Eclipse ships.
[*]🔗 [b]Core Dependencies:[/b] Core 5 mods are now hard requirements for each other.
[/list]

🐛 [b]BUG FIXES & OPTIMIZATION[/b]
[list]
[*]⚡ [b]Massive Engine Optimization:[/b] Conducted a massive quality upgrade across 28 core library files. Fixed severe server thread GC spikes by replacing 2,500 consecutive C++ boundary creations with native engine property checks.
[*]🔒 [b]Multiplayer Desync Fix (CRITICAL):[/b] Systematically purged all unstable Lua `math.random` calls, replacing them with deterministic `random():getInt()` generation to prevent cascading dedicated server desyncs!
[*]🛡️ [b]Arbitrary Code Execution (ACE) Patch:[/b] Hardened UI and background scripts. Malicious clients can no longer spoof remote calls or inject structural payloads into the server.
[*]💥 [b]Critical Engine Crash Prevention:[/b] Injected robust guard clauses across 13 core Vault APIs, permanently eliminating a class of Lua crashes when uninitialized variables or raw tables are passed to C++ bindings.
[*]🚀 [b]VFS Crash Fix:[/b] Migrated to namespace-aware Virtual File System logic, permanently preventing engine crashes caused by mod overlap.
[*]❤️ [b]DoT & HoT Persistence:[/b] Completely rewrote volatile ghost scripts into persistent update loops. HoTs and DoTs now reliably survive across sector reloads!
[*]🖥️ [b]UI & Codex Crash Protection:[/b] Hardened the parsing engine so missing categories safely skip rendering instead of crashing to desktop. Fixed blank panels and invisible UI sliders in the Config Menu.
[*]🌦️ [b]Weather & Event Logic Fixes:[/b] Fixed permanent storm debuff loops, weather client desynchronization, Rift Escalation math crashes, and Ambush spawn mutations.
[*]🐞 [b]Vanilla Bug Fixes:[/b] Patched a massive vanilla bug where Scout Missions skipped Faction Headquarters, and removed raw translator comments (e.g., `/* faction name */`) rendering in Galactic News.
[*]📈 [b]Economy & Faction Hardening:[/b] Fixed fatal Famine engine crashes, Custom Trait UI exceptions, and strictly guarded against self-relation modifications.
[/list]
